  "description": "ONE GR FULL CARBON INTEGRATED La piega OИE GR full carbon integrata, è progettata per il mondo Gravel Racing. Pensata per la totale integrazione dei cavi, migliora le performance in termini di rigidezza e aerodinamica e assicura un comfort elevato grazie all’apertura ottimizzata per terreni sconnessi.Info tecnichePESO 390 grammiFLARE 12°MISURE 38x80, 40x90, 42x100, 44x110\n\nScopri le ruote ITM Scopri di più sulle ruote ITM sviluppate in esclusiva per Bottecchia. SCOPRI DI PIU'\n\nRACING TECHNOLOGIES DEPARTMENT Designed for modern explorers and built to last, the GRAVEL TITAN is the new frontier of two-wheeled adventure. A brushed titanium frame with elegant yet functional lines, constructed with differentiated tubing to ensure rigidity where needed and comfort on any terrain. Internal cable routing maintains clean lines and protects the system from dust, mud, and the elements. Bikepacking-ready makes the GRAVEL TITAN the perfect companion for long rides, travel, and open-ended adventures. Generous tire clearance allows for tires up to 50 mm, allowing you to confidently tackle even the most technical trails. IDEAL FOR Whether you're tackling endless dirt roads, challenging climbs, or technical singletrack, the GRAVEL TITAN offers the perfect combination of responsiveness, comfort, and reliability. Every detail is designed to ensure high performance and a smooth ride, even after hundreds of kilometers. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you want a durable, high-performance bike to take you anywhere, on any type of route.",
